.*
!.gitignore
!.github

# Build artifacts
*_build
*__pycache__*
target
# `maturin develop` drops the compiled extension into the source
# package next to the stubs; it is a build output, not source.
*.so
*.pyd

# Scratch data at the repo root. Sample FITS files land here while
# chasing a bug, and the FITS standard / WCS papers get downloaded
# here to check a citation -- those are third-party copyrighted
# documents and must not be committed. Test fixtures live under
# `tests/data/`, which these patterns do not reach.
/*.fits
/*.fits.fz
/*.fits.gz
/*.tex
